A brand new Adeos port, this time for the StrongARM SA1100 arch
(2.4.19-rmk7-pxa2), is available here:
http://download.gna.org/adeos/patches/v2.4/arm/adeos-linux-2.4.19-arm-rmk7-pxa2-r11.patch

This port is based on the latest Adeos -r11 series for Linux 2.4 and has
been derived from the existing ATMEL port. Jerome Poichet
<jerome@domain.hid> has kindly provided the SA1100 specific
knowledge and bits. Many thanks to him.

